  IT DOES NOT HOLD FOUR. With a PERFECT index the bias reaches 0.276
  against 0.241 off and a chance of 0.250 (+0.035, 0.8 SE). The creature's
  own index cannot do better than the oracle, so the four-word ceiling is
  the BIAS MECHANISM and not the context -- `capacity`'s finding that a
  conflicting pair collapses to 0.22 reaching four tables. The work goes
  to making the bias larger, not to a four-word protocol.
